  ---
  Key API Endpoints

  Auth: POST /api/auth/register → POST /api/auth/login

  Orders: POST /api/orders (place buy/sell) → GET /api/orders/positions (live P&L)

  Payment: POST /api/payments/create → Cashfree link → POST /api/payments/webhook

  Admin: /api/admin/stocks (enable stocks) · /api/admin/users · /api/admin/leaderboard/dummy

  ---
  Business Logic Highlights

  - 48h free trial → auto-set on registration
  - ₹500 payment → ₹99 platform fee + ₹401 feeBalance + ₹5cr dummyBalance
  - ₹2 deducted per trade from feeBalance via MongoDB transaction
  - Live prices via AngelOne SmartWebSocket → Socket.IO rooms (stock:{token})
  - Default admin auto-seeded: admin@trading.com / Admin@123

  ---
  Next Steps

  1. Set your ANGELONE_CLIENT_ID, ANGELONE_PASSWORD, ANGELONE_TOTP_SECRET in .env
  2. Call POST /api/admin/angelone/init-session to activate live price feeds
  3. Import postman/TradingApp.postman_collection.json into Postman to test all endpoints
